    "The falsifier defines fail below behavioral minimum and pass at/above it plus three diagnostics, but the mixed_if condition is not exhaustive: an effect meeting the behavior threshold but fewer than three diagnostics is neither falsified nor passed and is classified mixed by the stated boolean expression."
  ]
}
EOF

